      "id": "durable-ordered-primary-run",
      "type": "positive",
      "statement": "One primary Run and one valid initial receipt per admitted WorkItem survive concurrent receipt and process restart with append-only ordered history through a terminal state, while caller-owned rollback removes both WorkItem and initial Run receipt.",
